			"SHA": "a19877c3f8bcb8709ddbe7d8f836f6e5d47496d8"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-30T05:24:42Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				648,
				2
			],
			"Message": "feat(Cocoon): Add codegen entry point and public exports\n\nAdd the runnable CLI entry point (`Codegen.ts`) that invokes the extension-host codegen pipeline, and the public module surface (`index.ts`) re-exporting all types and functions.\n\n`Codegen.ts` is invoked by Cocoon's `prepublishOnly.sh` build hook. It resolves source/output paths from `process.cwd()` (Cocoon's package root) pointing to the VS Code editor source tree and the Cocoon output directory respectively. It handles exit codes: non-zero for internal failures, exit code 2 for codegen failures, and exits cleanly on success with a summary of records emitted and duration.\n\n`index.ts` exports the full public API including:\n- `RunExtHostCodegen` orchestrator and its options/summary types\n- `IterateExtHostDecorators` async iterator and `IsExtHostFile` predicate\n- `EmitExtHostSchema` emitter with its options/outcome types\n- `ExtHostDecoratorRecord` type\n\nThis completes the codegen infrastructure added in the previous commit, making it callable from the build system.",
			"SHA": "537d7bfd6b1caa68baa0f0b62cebb5346acdeb6a"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-30T05:22:31Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				646,
				5
			],
			"Message": "feat(Cocoon): Add extension-host codegen infrastructure\n\nAdd Cocoon-side codegen pipeline that mirrors Wind's ServiceSchema codegen but targets the extension-host decorator family (`IExtHost*`).\n\nNew files:\n- `Type/ExtHostDecoratorRecord.ts` - Record type for extHost decorators, mirrors Wind's ServiceDecoratorRecord\n- `Extract/IsExtHostFile.ts` - Predicate filtering to `vs/workbench/api/*/extHost*.ts`\n- `Extract/IterateExtHostDecorators.ts` - Async iterator emitting one record per `createDecorator` site, resolves cross-file interfaces and records paired MainThread counterpart\n- `Emit/EmitExtHostSchema.ts` - Emits schema files under `Cocoon/Source/Effect/Generated/<Decorator>/<Decorator>Upstream.ts`\n- `RunExtHostCodegen.ts` - Top-level orchestrator reusing Wind's source-tree walker and extractors verbatim\n\nThe codegen reuses all Wind extractors and resolvers - no parser duplication. It scopes the tree walk to extHost files and records the paired `MainThreadFooShape` identifier so the bridge can wire both ends of the RPC.",
			"SHA": "1db2b302f8ef8b2ede66cdf98e3a6c4702c2c127"
		},
